anced layout with a perfectly scaling difficulty curve and constantly updating new challenges.\n- Diverse Power-Ups & Custom Weapons: Unleash massive destruction with Slow-Mo, Stop, Rewind, Paint, Guided Aim, devastating Marbles Bombs, and the rapid-firing Minigun!\n- True VR Immersion: Fully optimized for Quest devices. Play standing or seated with highly accurate eye-level perspective and smooth physics.\n- Global Localization: Seamlessly available in multiple languages including English, Turkish, French, Spanish, Italian, and German.\n- Safe Progression & Credits: Features full cloud/local save data protection and dedicated credits section.\n\nCan you clear the ancient paths and become the ultimate marble master? Download Marble Swoop now and test your reflexes!", "short_description": "Experience the ultimate VR action-puzzle game. Match colors, blast rolling spheres, use powerful custom weapons, and conquer challenging temples in a stunning virtual reality environment!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://marble-swoop.netlify.app/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Redwilo", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://marble-swoop.netlify.app/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "tr", "fr", "es", "it", "de"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"]